From: abhay-byte <abhay02delhi@gmail.com>
Date: 2026-10-04
Subject: [PATCH jm-v9 003] panvk: report Vulkan 1.1 on v9

Purpose: Report Vulkan apiVersion 1.1 on Valhall v9 JM instead of 1.3
Tested GPU: Mali-G57 MC2 (Lenovo TB336FU, gpu_id 0x90930010)
Tested Kbase UAPI: JM 11.0
Mesa base range: 5a07217f + g615-v11-csf series
Dependencies: all g615-v11-csf families (applied on top)
Validation test: validation/v9-jm/

---
diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
index 9eb316f..266bb56 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
@@ -813,10 +813,14 @@ get_api_version()
    if (version_override)
       return version_override;
 
+#if PAN_ARCH == 9
+   return VK_MAKE_API_VERSION(0, 1, 1, VK_HEADER_VERSION);
+#else
    if (PAN_ARCH >= 10)
       return VK_MAKE_API_VERSION(0, 1, 4, VK_HEADER_VERSION);
 
    return VK_MAKE_API_VERSION(0, 1, 3, VK_HEADER_VERSION);
+#endif
 }
 
 static VkConformanceVersion
